I am applying for the Sr Software Engineer - Agentic Applications (Full Stack=
) role at Databricks. At Black Piano, I build production data pipelines and a=
gentic tooling in Python. My work includes developing a self-healing data-qua=
lity agent powered by Gemini that autonomously resolves missing brand domains=
 via reference-table lookups with LLM fallback, retries three times on failur=
e, and escalates to human review. I also built a custom MCP tool enabling non=
-technical teams to generate data-grounded content from single-line prompts a=
nd engineered automated AI insight pipelines using ChatGPT.

In my independent projects, I engineer full-stack agent architectures and eva=
luation harnesses. I built MyLocalCLI, an open-source terminal coding assista=
nt published on npm featuring 42 built-in tools, dynamic prompt engineering s=
kills, parallel tool execution, an Stdio MCP bridge, and automatic provider f=
ailover across local and cloud LLM endpoints. Through AgentSwarm, I orchestra=
ted autonomous multi-agent workflows across multiple CLI substrates, enforcin=
g execution boundaries through an independent oracle and an external hash-cha=
ined audit ledger that recorded zero violations across 1,254 tool calls.

Databricks leads the industry in uniting enterprise data platforms with produ=
ction compound AI systems and agentic applications. I would welcome the oppor=
tunity to discuss how my hands-on agent engineering and verification backgrou=
nd align with your team's goals.

